  "analysis_md": "$\\sin\\dfrac1{1-z}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^n}{(2n+1)!}\\left(\\dfrac1{1-z}\\right)^{2n+1}=\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty}\\dfrac{(-1)^{n+1}}{(2n+1)!}\\dfrac1{(z-1)^{2n+1}}$，故 $z=1$ 为本性奇点。",
